    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/4bd4a53c7e9b565f70b4d19d5460cc59.poster.avif?t=1752085539\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/4bd4a53c7e9b565f70b4d19d5460cc59.webm?t=1752085539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/4bd4a53c7e9b565f70b4d19d5460cc59.mp4?t=1752085539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Fix This House</strong> is a relaxing and colorful puzzle game where your task is to fix the building using a variety of blocks. Arrange the blocks as you please, and add the finishing touch with a roof or a slab. Unleash your inner architect, all while enjoying the soothing sounds of nature and music. Solve puzzles, explore the world, and take your time!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/cf0a5cf7680da7641ebfa4f69cb984ad.webp?t=1752085539\" width=600 height=48 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/bc83d69d5dbb5fe88c5c0b9900f1acbc.poster.avif?t=1752085539\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/bc83d69d5dbb5fe88c5c0b9900f1acbc.webm?t=1752085539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/bc83d69d5dbb5fe88c5c0b9900f1acbc.mp4?t=1752085539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Easily place and arrange blocks with <strong>intuitive controls</strong>, letting you focus on the creative process of rebuilding and designing beautiful structures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/01ac30940ba85c9f1a51e0e9dc391409.webp?t=1752085539\" width=600 height=48 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/1711e11006f86b4e58b71da790375ce4.poster.avif?t=1752085539\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/1711e11006f86b4e58b71da790375ce4.webm?t=1752085539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/1711e11006f86b4e58b71da790375ce4.mp4?t=1752085539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It's not that simple. <strong>Explore</strong> the puzzle, <strong>discover</strong> new possibilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/44305a9dba0b3d91cfa18cc888cbdbdd.webp?t=1752085539\" width=600 height=48 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/14eae6474e928f21d038269ec9d919a2.poster.avif?t=1752085539\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/14eae6474e928f21d038269ec9d919a2.webm?t=1752085539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996860/extras/14eae6474e928f21d038269ec9d919a2.mp4?t=1752085539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Enjoy <strong>soothing music</strong> and the <strong>calming sounds</strong> of nature, from chirping crickets to the gentle waves of the sea.<br><br><s